<sect1 id="cmake" xreflabel="CMake-&cmake-version;">
  <?dbhtml filename="cmake.html"?>

  <title>CMake-&cmake-version;</title>

  <indexterm zone="cmake">
    <primary sortas="a-CMake">CMake</primary>
  </indexterm>

  <sect2 role="package">
    <title>Introduction to CMake</title>

    <para>
      The CMake package contains a modern toolset used for generating
      Makefiles. It is a successor of the auto-generated
      <command>configure</command> script and aims to be platform and
      compiler independent. A significant user of CMake is KDE since version 4.
    </para>

    &long-build-time;

    <itemizedlist spacing="compact">
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Download: <ulink url="&cmake-download;"/>
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </itemizedlist>

